            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "41.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwami Nebukadinesa owe Babiloni arobora mala amiisia Kedalia, okhwa Ahikamu lundi omwichukhulu owa Shafani aaba omwimeelesi owe babaandu babarama mu Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banamae bakhulu boosi be kamae be lukoongo baulila bali omwami wabwe aroboore Kedalia khuba omuruki. Nga baulila ako, boosi becha ne banamae babwe e Misipa. Banamae bakhulu abo baba Ishimaeli okhwa Netania, Yoanani okhwa Karea, Seraya okhwa Tanihumeti, khukhwama mu lukoba lwa Netofa, ne Yasania khukhwama Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedalia abechubila ne banamae babwe ne aloma ali, “Mukharia sikila babemeelesi Bakalidayo tawe. Menya mu sibala sino, mala mukholele omwami owa Babiloni. Ne buli sisiindu sibe silayi khwinywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali mu mwesi kukhola saba, Ishimaeli, okhwa Netania lundi omwichukhulu owa Elishama wenju eye bubwami echa ne babaandu ekhumi ebwaakala Kedalia, mala amwiira. Lundi eera Baisiraeli ne Bakalidayo ba baaba e Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 43.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Baisiraeli boosi, bakhulu ne batiiti sitube, ne babemeelesi be kamae barekukha belukhila e Misiri sikila baba bariire Bakalidayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini alekhulwa arure mu siboe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola kamakhumi kataru na saba kwo mwami Yehoyakini owa Yuda khuba mu mbaambe, Ebilimerodaki arakikha khukhwamiia Babiloni. Ako kekholekha khu ndaalo ekhola kamakhumi kabili na saba eye kumwesi kwe khumi na kibili. Nga arakikha khukhwamiia Ebilimerodaki arusia Yehoyakini khukhwama mu mbaame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Ebilimerodaki alomaloma ne Yehoyakini bulayi. Lundi Ebilimerodaki aelesia Yehoyakini endebe eye lukoosi khukhila chindebe che babaami ba baaba ne naye e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yehoyakini afuula chingubo chewe che mu siboe, mala mu bulamu bwewe bubwarama bwoosi alichanga khu sialwa sio mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli endaalo, khulwe bulamu bwewe bubwarama bwoosi aelesibwanga chirupia che khurumikhira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
